    "title": "LESSON 8: WORD ORDER (V2 RULE)",
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "In a statement, the conjugated VERB is",
          "always the SECOND ELEMENT.",
          "",
          "[Ich] [gehe] [heute] [nach Hause].",
          "  1     2      3        4",
          "(I'm going home today)",
          "",
          "[Heute] [gehe] [ich] [nach Hause].",
          "   1      2     3        4",
          "When 'heute' comes first, the verb stays",
          "second, and 'ich' moves behind it.",
          "",
          "An element can be several words:",
          "[Im Sommer] [fahren] [wir] [ans Meer].",
          "",
          "Yes/no questions: verb first (Kommst du mit?)",
          "Exception: after dass, weil, wenn, obwohl",
          "the verb goes to the END (see NEBENSÄTZE)."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Lektion acht"
      }
    ]
